Question 62 — VIEW vs MATERIALIZED VIEW
VIEW
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW example_view AS
SELECT *
FROM orders;
MATERIALIZED VIEW
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW example_materialized_view AS
SELECT *
FROM orders;

Main difference:

VIEW
→ Does not physically store the result
→ Query runs when accessed
→ Always reflects current underlying data
→ Usually requires less storage

MATERIALIZED VIEW
→ Stores query result physically
→ Faster for repeated complex reports
→ Data can become outdated
→ Requires REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW
